      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">The survey your designer, builder or council asks for before plans are drawn. Torrens Survey Co puts Adelaide owners in touch with an independent Licensed Surveyor, who quotes the job directly.</p>
